  "description": "Plonked right into the world of a novel she once read, Sophie simply wishes to live out the rest of her quiet life in the background. Who could ask for a better place than the sleepy village of Pellun? And it was wonderful, peaceful... until knights came in searching for Lady Amelia. The Amelia Cedric from the most powerful noble family in the Rohatin Empire? Wait, it can't be... I'm just an extra!\n\n(Source: POCKET COMICS)\n\n*Note: Includes five extra chapters.*",
